---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section style="max-width: 760px; padding-top: 4rem;">
    <h1 style="
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    ">
      A system,<br />not a platform.
    </h1>

    <p style="
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    ">
      Most products optimize for engagement.
      ETHOS is designed to optimize for fit.
    </p>

    <!-- Core principle -->
    <div style="
      border-left: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
      max-width: 620px;
    ">
      <p>
        The system starts with identity — not behavior,
        not preferences, and not content.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- System flow -->
    <div style="
      display: grid;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    ">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
          1. Identity
        </h2>
        <p style="max-width: 620px;">
          ETHOS models how a person thinks, decides,
          relates, and adapts across contexts.
          This remains stable even as tastes change.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
          2. Signal
        </h2>
        <p style="max-width: 620px;">
          Identity is translated into clear signals —
          what environments support you,
          what drains you, and what compounds over time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
          3. Experience
        </h2>
        <p style="max-width: 620px;">
          ETHOS uses signal to align people,
          places, and experiences —
          without manipulating attention.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contrast -->
    <div style="
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    ">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        How this is different
      </h2>

      <div style="
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
        max-width: 680px;
      ">
        <div>
          <strong>Platforms</strong>
          <p>
            React to behavior.
            Optimize engagement.
            Increase noise.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>ETHOS</strong>
          <p>
            Starts with identity.
            Optimizes alignment.
            Reduces noise.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Closing -->
    <div>
      <p style="max-width: 560px;">
        ETHOS is not trying to keep people inside a product.
        It’s designed to help people move through life
        with more clarity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
